DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270912
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270913
SUMMARY:National Grandparents Day
DESCRIPTION:National Grandparents Day falls on the first Sunday in Septembe
 r after Labor Day\, which makes it one of the few American observances who
 se date is set by statute rather than by custom. It exists because of a de
 cade-long campaign by Marian McQuade\, a West Virginia woman with 15 child
 ren and 43 grandchildren who thought the country's oldest generation was b
 eing left alone. The usual version of the story credits a single 1978 sign
 ature\; the paper trail is two steps\, a year apart.\n\nhttps://todayceleb
 rates.com/holiday/national-grandparents-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-grandparents-day
 /
CATEGORIES:Kids & Family
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
